  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Qt: Fix adaptive height for headers when zooming",
  "description": "This introduces AdaptiveHeaderView, a class that reacts on changeEvents\nfor the font and forces a recalculation of the, height of the header\nwith the font size.\n\nChange !25191 created a fontmanager who acts as the single authority\nfor fonts and also zooming the fonts. The header views did not register\nwith the change, so that when one zoomed the font size, the height of\nthe headers remained the same.\n\nFixes: #21293\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
