          "id": 3414635880,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Now the header height is too big for the text. This used to be tuned for optimal packet list.\n\nNew:\n\n![Screenshot_2026-06-03_at_08.21.07](/uploads/1b32e64547b4bef2e13f9ba076d7af23/Screenshot_2026-06-03_at_08.21.07.png){width=429 height=90}\n\nOld:\n\n![Screenshot_2026-06-03_at_08.18.49](/uploads/400805122780a9678b2c5b6daea4f25d/Screenshot_2026-06-03_at_08.18.49.png){width=395 height=85}",
          "author": {
